{"version":1,"content":"<p>警方發現紅磡區內有貴金屬加工工場懷疑聘用非法勞工，拘捕4人，分別涉嫌「僱用不可合法受僱的人」及「違反逗留條件」。</p><p>案件明日（29日）於九龍城裁判法院提堂。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T10:42:03.424826+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":77,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T10:24:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T14:18:15.274342+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T10:38:20.543222+00:00","content_hash":"75e7c2bfdbd2dd1a1525a606bea155190821b43d5c863f603e80398ae96b514d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}